      <h1 id="cluster-api-config-options-rhosp" class="group scroll-mt-20">Cluster API configuration options for Red Hat OpenStack Platform<a href="#cluster-api-config-options-rhosp" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>You can change the configuration of your Red Hat OpenStack Platform (RHOSP) Cluster API machines by updating values in the Cluster API custom resource manifests.</p>
