      <h3 id="capi-yaml-machine-set-rhosp_cluster-api-config-options-rhosp" class="group scroll-mt-20">Sample YAML for a Cluster API compute machine set resource on RHOSP<a href="#capi-yaml-machine-set-rhosp_cluster-api-config-options-rhosp" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
